      "says": [
        {
          "text": "A wayhouse on a road with a hole in it, doing better trade than the road can account for, and a landlord who knows exactly why."
        },
        {
          "text": "“Beds, stew, and I will tell you the road is impassable whether it is or not.”"
        }
